{
  "//": [
    ".mcp.json TEMPLATE — KB-mcp-platform/assets/templates/mcp.json.tmpl",
    "Customized by Plan T2.4 + substituted at repo root .mcp.json.",
    "Canonical inventory: 5 named MCP servers (was 7; mcp-openapi-schema removed",
    "2026-05-24 per postmortem; gitnexus removed 2026-05-27 per ADR-0066 — see",
    "KB-mcp-platform/SKILL.md and .devcontainer/postCreate.sh for deprecation notes).",
    "Credential handling: env-block indirection only (ADR-0039); env-var names from",
    ".devcontainer/versions.env or devcontainer.json containerEnv.",
    "Replace <PIN_TBD> with actual pin values from versions.env per Plan T1.3."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "actionlint-mcp": {
      "command": "actionlint-mcp",
      "args": []
    },
    "context7": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://mcp.context7.com/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "CONTEXT7_API_KEY": "${CONTEXT7_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    "exa": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://mcp.exa.ai/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "x-api-key": "${EXA_API_KEY}"
      }
    },
    "serena": {
      "command": "serena",
      "args": ["start-mcp-server"]
    },
    "terraform-mcp": {
      "command": "terraform-mcp",
      "args": [],
      "env": {
        "TFE_TOKEN": "${TFE_TOKEN}"
      }
    }
  }
}
